# SDD Enforcement Rule

## Trigger
Applies when user asks to implement a feature/process.

## Protocol
1. Check if there is a relevant spec in `docs/specs/`.
2. If spec missing, create one before broad implementation.
3. If plan missing, create `docs/plans/<ticket>-plan.md`.
4. Implement strictly within approved scope.
5. Update `memory_bank/progress.md` after meaningful completion.
